nergy, dramatic motion, and a powerful sense of progression from the first frame to the last frame. The first image is the opening state: the player is charging forward while dribbling aggressively at high speed on the court, surrounded by explosive blue energy. The second image is the final destination frame: the player has exploded upward into the air and is performing a powerful one-handed dunk at the rim, with the blue energy bursting behind him.\n\nFrom 0.0 to 3.0 seconds, begin from the first-frame composition. The player drives forward at high speed with a low, aggressive posture, dribbling the basketball while sprinting across the court. His body leans forward with strong momentum, shoes gripping and pushing off the floor, and the blue energy trails flare behind him like lightning and flames. The crowd and court lights blur slightly to emphasize speed and intensity. His facial expression is focused, fierce, and calm under pressure.\n\nFrom 3.0 to 6.5 seconds, the player continues the fast break, takes longer explosive strides, crosses into his gather steps, and transitions from dribbling into an attack toward the basket. He pulls the ball under control, plants his foot powerfully, and gathers momentum. The blue aura intensifies and expands, wrapping around his body and leaving vivid electric streaks across the frame. The scene should feel like the turning point before a decisive highlight play, like a climax in a high-energy Japanese basketball anime.\n\nFrom 6.5 to 9.0 seconds, he launches upward into the air with an explosive jump. His knees lift, torso rises, and one arm extends outward with the basketball as he ascends toward the hoop. The camera follows the upward action with dramatic anime-like intensity, emphasizing his athletic body line, the glowing blue energy storm around him, and the crowd erupting in anticipation. The motion should feel powerful, fluid, and heroic, with a clear sense of lift and suspended force.\n\nFrom 9.0 to 10.0 seconds, reso