wd excitement, impact takeoff sound, rim and net sound at the dunk, and a powerful anime-style soundtrack. Use hype sports-anime music with fast percussion, electric guitar or synthetic pulses, uplifting strings, and a big emotional rise toward the dunk finish.\n\nVoice and language: include a short Chinese internal monologue or shouted line from the player during the run-up and dunk, delivered with hot-blooded determination. Suggested lines:\n“拦不住我——”\n“就是现在！”\n“给我进去！”\nThe voice should feel youthful, fierce, and energetic, naturally synchronized with the action and mixed with the crowd and music.\n\nMaintain strong temporal consistency across the whole sequence. Keep the player’s face, hairstyle, tattoos, jersey number 18, blue energy style, court environment, and anime rendering stable. Avoid face drift, body distortion, extra limbs, broken ball motion, weak jump transition, inconsistent hoop placement, chaotic camera shake, or style drift. Prioritize a smooth and exciting progression from fast dribble drive to explosive airborne dunk, ending in a strong match to the final frame."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "正向提示词 / Positive Prompt", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [370, 390], "pos": [-1110.4423828125, 4610.52880859375], "id": 146, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [254], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "size": [270, 82], "pos": [-651.4853515625, 4558.34521484375], "widgets_values": ["auto", false], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 258, "label": "model", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "sage_attention"}, "name": "sage_attention", "label": "sage_attention", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "sage_attention"}, {"wid